  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CEFORD - Strengthening Civic Participation for Effective Accountability and Transparency in Public Sector (SEAT) Project in West Nile</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.	To increase Capacity and Responsiveness of Local Government leaders to deliver on public services and citizens needs in selected West Nile Districts. 
2.	To strengthen the capacity of CSOs and Media to engage Governments for Accountable and Responsive Governance in selected West Nile Districts. 
3.	To increase Civic Participation of Youth, Women and Persons with Disabilities (PWDs) in good governance, advocacy and social accountability in selected West Nile Districts.</narrative>
  </description>
